WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.780
- Everybody else has already
done text interactive stories

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:05.933
or adventure games.

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.606
You know what we need to do?

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.513
And I say, what?

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.630
We need to go beyond that.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.453
We need to add graphics to it.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.580
And I was like, oh my God, oh my God,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.533
he's gonna do it, he's gonna do it.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.200
- [Bold Voice] There was just one problem.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.303
What Ken proposed had never been done.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.490
- I love a good technical challenge

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:37.380
and since computers are new,
everything was new and cold.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.060
- [Bold Voice] Games back
then came on a floppy disc.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.890
The USB drives at their time,

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.063
but they only had about 360 K of storage.

00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:49.700
That's just a few seconds
of a streaming song.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.810
Forget about pictures.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.130
- These days it would be easy.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:56.530
I mean it's but it was
a different world then.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.930
So rather than just
digitizing the pictures,

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:03.623
I had an idea of using the end
points of lines as graphics.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.220
That allowed me to fit all the pictures

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.913
and a whole game on one floppy.

00:01:12.187 --> 00:01:15.428
- "Mystery House" was the
very very first computer game

00:01:15.428 --> 00:01:17.280
that had graphics.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.800
It was a huge leap technologically

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.690
- [Bold Voice] The images were simple,

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:29.080
straightforward, nothing fancy.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:33.030
But to see this on a personal
computer was a revelation.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.673
- This is the beginning of something big.

